        "id": null,
        "inlines": [
          {
            "kind": "text",
            "value": "The following section provides an overview of the internals of the TestContext framework. If you are interested only in using the framework and are not interested in extending it with your own custom listeners or custom loaders, feel free to go directly to the configuration ("
